# tt-metal writes its Inspector/Watcher output to ./generated/ relative to the
# process CWD unless TT_METAL_LOGS_PATH is pinned. The daemon and the
# integration conftest both pin it (runner/env.py:runner_environ), but an
# ad-hoc script that constructs a Folder directly does not -- and that lands
# tens of MB per fold in the working tree. Ignored so it can never be
# committed by accident.
generated/
